msgstr "Kako naj Kadupul obravnava beleženje dogodkov?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Splošna raven dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file?  WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Kako podrobne podatke želite pošiljati v datoteko dnevnika?  OPOZORILO: če pustite katero koli drugo stanje kot NONE ali LOW, lahko hitro zapolnite prostor na disku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Input Validation Issues"
msgstr "Beleži težave pri preverjanju vnosa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Record when request fields are accessed without going through proper input validation"
msgstr "Zabeleži, kdaj se do polj zahtevka dostopa mimo ustreznega preverjanja vnosa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Tracing"
msgstr "Sledenje virom podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A developer only option to trace the creation of Data Sources mainly around checks for uniqueness"
msgstr "Možnost samo za razvijalce za sledenje ustvarjanja virov podatkov, predvsem pri preverjanju enoličnosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective File Debug"
msgstr "Izbirno razhroščevanje datotek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select which files you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files selected will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Izberite, katere datoteke želite postaviti v način razhroščevanja ne glede na nastavitev splošne ravni dnevnika.  Vse izbrane datoteke bodo obravnavane, kot da so v načinu razhroščevanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective Plugin Debug"
msgstr "Izbirno razhroščevanje vtičnikov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select which Plugins you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files used by this plugin will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Izberite, katere vtičnike želite postaviti v način razhroščevanja ne glede na nastavitev splošne ravni dnevnika.  Vse datoteke, ki jih uporablja ta vtičnik, bodo obravnavane, kot da so v načinu razhroščevanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective Device Debug"
msgstr "Izbirno razhroščevanje naprav"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of Device IDs that you wish to be in Debug mode during data collection.  This Debug level is only in place during the Kadupul polling process."
msgstr "Z vejico ločen seznam ID-jev naprav, ki jih želite imeti v načinu razhroščevanja med zbiranjem podatkov.  Ta raven razhroščevanja velja samo med postopkom poizvedovanja Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Syslog/Eventlog Item Selection"
msgstr "Izbor elementov Syslog/Eventlog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Kadupul log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr "Pri uporabi Syslog/Eventlog za beleženje so to sporočila dnevnika Kadupul, ki bodo posredovana v Syslog/Eventlog."

