#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose 'enabled' to allow the localization of Kadupul. The strict mode requires that the requested language will also be supported by all plugins being installed at your system. If that is not the case, everything will be displayed in English."
msgstr "Izberite »enabled«, če želite omogočiti lokalizacijo Kadupul. Strogi način zahteva, da zahtevani jezik podpirajo tudi vsi vtičniki, nameščeni v vašem sistemu. Če to ni tako, bo vse prikazano v angleščini."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jezik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default language for this system."
msgstr "Privzeti jezik za ta sistem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Language Detection"
msgstr "Samodejno zaznavanje jezika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow to automatically determine the 'default' language of the user and provide it at login time if that language is supported by Kadupul. If disabled, the default language will be in force until the user elects another language."
msgstr "Dovoli samodejno določitev »privzetega« jezika uporabnika in njegovo uporabo ob prijavi, če Kadupul ta jezik podpira. Če je onemogočeno, velja privzeti jezik, dokler uporabnik ne izbere drugega jezika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Preferred Language Processor"
msgstr "Prednostni jezikovni procesor"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Kadupul includes support for multiple alternate Language Translation Processors.  If none is selected Kadupul will attempt to use the first one found."
msgstr "Kadupul vključuje podporo za več nadomestnih procesorjev za prevajanje jezikov.  Če ni izbran noben, bo Kadupul poskusil uporabiti prvega najdenega."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Client TimeZone Support"
msgstr "Podpora časovnemu pasu odjemalca"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How should Kadupul support Client Dates based upon the Client browser's timezone."
msgstr "Kako naj Kadupul podpira datume odjemalca glede na časovni pas brskalnika odjemalca."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Date Display Format"
msgstr "Oblika prikaza datuma"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The System default date format to use in Kadupul."
msgstr "Privzeta sistemska oblika datuma, ki se uporablja v Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Date Separator"
msgstr "Ločilo datuma"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The System default date separator to be used in Kadupul."
msgstr "Privzeto sistemsko ločilo datuma, ki se uporablja v Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Other Settings"
msgstr "Druge nastavitve"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show only site specific locations"
msgstr "Pokaži samo lokacije, specifične za mesto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show only locations that are available at a device's selected site."
msgstr "Pokaži samo lokacije, ki so na voljo na mestu, izbranem za napravo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Has Graphs/Data Sources Checked"
msgstr "Ima preverjene grafe/vire podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the Has Graphs and Has Data Sources be Checked by Default?"
msgstr "Ali naj bosta »Ima grafe« in »Ima vire podatkov« privzeto preverjena?"

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RRDtool Version"
msgstr "Različica RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The version of RRDtool that you have installed."
msgstr "Različica RRDtool, ki jo imate nameščeno."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Gradient Support"
msgstr "Omogoči podporo gradientom"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables Gradient Support for AREA and STACK charts."
msgstr "Omogoči podporo gradientom za grafe AREA in STACK."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Način dovoljenj za grafe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Dostop do grafa je v vsakem načinu odobren neposredno z dovoljenjem za graf. Permisivni način dodatno odobri dostop, ko ima uporabnik dovoljenje za napravo ali predlogo grafa. Restriktivni način, kadar ni neposrednega dovoljenja za graf, zahteva dovoljenje za napravo in predlogo. Način na podlagi naprav zahteva dovoljenje za napravo, način na podlagi predlog grafov pa dovoljenje za predlogo. Pravilniki uporabnikov in skupin se ovrednotijo ločeno, njihovi dovoljeni rezultati pa se združijo. Ti načini na velikih namestitvah zamenjujejo zmogljivost poizvedb za natančnejša dovoljenja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Permisivno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Restriktivno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Na podlagi naprav"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Način ustvarjanja grafov/virov podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Če je nastavljeno na Enostavno, je grafe in vire podatkov mogoče ustvariti samo iz možnosti Novi grafi.  Pri Napredno je podprto starejše ustvarjanje grafov in virov podatkov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Enostavno"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Napredno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Pokaži pomoč za obrazce/nastavitve sproti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be shown inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo pomoč za obrazce in nastavitve prikazana sproti.  Sicer bo prikazana ob premiku miške nad gumb za pomoč."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Samo lokalna pomoč strani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Kadupul page help is located at kadupul.org.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of your Kadupul server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Privzeto se pomoč strani Kadupul nahaja na kadupul.org.  Če pa vaš sistem nima dostopa do interneta, lahko dokumentacijo prenesete lokalno v obliki HTML in jo gostite na mestu »docs« na strežniku Kadupul.  Če želite za dokumentacijo pomoči strani uporabljati samo lokalno mesto, označite to potrditveno polje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Potrditev izbrisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Pred izbrisom elementa vprašaj uporabnika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Prednastavitev ohranjanja virov podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Ko je omogočeno, bo Kadupul pri odstranjevanju grafov nastavil izbirni gumb na izbris povezanih virov podatkov grafa.  Opomba: Kadupul ne dovoli odstranitve virov podatkov, če se uporabljajo v drugih grafih."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Samodejno odklepanje grafov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Ko je omogočeno, Kadupul ne bo zaklepal grafov.  To omogoča hitrejše ročno spreminjanje virov podatkov, povezanih z grafom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Kadupul Dashboard"
msgstr "Skrij nadzorno ploščo Kadupul"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Kadupul's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Kadupul Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Za uporabo s podporo za zunanje povezave Kadupul.  S to nastavitvijo lahko skrijete nadzorno ploščo Kadupul, da prikažete samo svojo stran."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Omogoči povleci in spusti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Kadupul's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired users, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Nekateri vmesniki Kadupul podpirajo povleci in spusti.  Če je označeno, bo ta možnost omogočena.  Opomba: za slabovidne uporabnike je ta možnost lahko onemogočena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Varnost mesta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Vsili povezave prek HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bodo vsi poskusi dostopa do Kadupul preusmerjeni na HTTPS za zagotovitev visoke varnosti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Dovoli nevaren HTTPS oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Dovoli uporabo samopodpisanih potrdil in dovoli, da se ime gostitelja v potrdilu razlikuje od imena oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Dovoli nevarne metaznake v metodah vnosa podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Zgodovinsko so skrbniki Kadupul ustvarjali preproste metode vnosa podatkov, ki vključujejo ukaze, kot je \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\", za predstavitev številske vrednosti za uporabo v grafih Kadupul.  V starejših različicah Kadupul je bilo to dovoljeno.  Vendar je to nevarna praksa, saj omogoča tretjim uporabnikom objavo nevarnih predlog podatkov.  V sodobnem Kadupulu se je takšnim praksam treba izogibati.  Kljub temu ponujamo to možnost, če imate starejše metode vnosa podatkov, ki vsebujejo te nevarne metaznake in jih niste pretvorili v lokalne skripte v imeniku »scripts«.  Ko ta možnost ni označena, Kadupul omeji metaznake v slogu lupine, kot so narekovaji, zaviti oklepaji, navpične črte, poševnice nazaj in vzvratni narekovaji.  Kadupul še naprej dovoljuje znaka večje in manjše za stvari, kot je <path_cacti>, in za vhodne parametre, vendar je, ko ta možnost ni označena, to meja njune dovoljene uporabe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Pravilnik skriptov Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy. The Nonce Mode - Reporting Only choice reports inline scripts that lack a nonce without blocking them. The implementation also supports an enforcing nonce mode through direct configuration, but this mode is not offered here because many built-in pages and plugins still use inline scripts without nonces. Enabling enforcement before those scripts are migrated can break pages and plugins. Use CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute() when adding inline scripts."
msgstr "Nadzira pravilnik CSP script-src. Izbira Način nonce – samo poročanje poroča o vgrajenih skriptih brez nonce, ne da bi jih blokirala. Izvedba prek neposredne konfiguracije podpira tudi uveljavljeni način nonce, vendar ta način tukaj ni ponujen, ker številne vgrajene strani in vtičniki še vedno uporabljajo vgrajene skripte brez nonce. Omogočitev uveljavljanja, preden so ti skripti preneseni, lahko pokvari strani in vtičnike. Pri dodajanju vgrajenih skriptov uporabite CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Dovoli vgrajeni JavaScript brez nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Dovoli unsafe-eval in vgrajeni JavaScript brez nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Način nonce – samo poročanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI poročila o kršitvah CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL, na katerega brskalniki pošiljajo (POST) poročila o kršitvah CSP v načinih nonce-report in nonce. Pustite prazno za uporabo <url_path>/csp_report.php. Vsebovati mora samo varne znake URL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Nadomestni viri Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Z presledki ločena imena domen, do katerih bo dovoljen dostop zunaj samega spletnega strežnika.  To je pomembno za uporabnike, ki uporabljajo CDN ali gostiteljsko mesto.  Viri lahko vključujejo nadomestne znake, na primer: *.mydomain.com, ali protokol, na primer: https://*.example.com.  Ti nadomestni viri vključujejo samo vrste slik, CSS in JavaScript."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL, na katerega brskalniki pošiljajo (POST) poročila o kršitvah CSP v načinih nonce-report in nonce. Pustite prazno za uporabo /cacti/csp_report.php v korenu namestitve. Vsebovati mora samo varne znake URL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno ustvarjanje grafov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ko je onemogočeno, Kadupul Automation ne bo dejavno ustvarjal nobenih grafov.  To je uporabno pri prilagajanju nastavitev naprav, da se izognete ustvarjanju novih grafov ob vsakem shranjevanju objekta.  Ročno sprožanje pravil avtomatizacije bo še vedno mogoče."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno ustvarjanje elementov drevesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Ko je onemogočeno, Kadupul Automation ne bo dejavno ustvarjal nobenih elementov drevesa.  To je uporabno pri prilagajanju nastavitev naprav ali grafov, da se izognete ustvarjanju novih vnosov drevesa ob vsakem shranjevanju objekta.  Ročno sprožanje pravil bo še vedno mogoče."

