#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Če želite postopek poizvedovanja popolnoma ustaviti, počistite to polje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Podpora agentu SNMP omogočena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Če je ta možnost označena, bo Kadupul tabele agenta SNMP zapolnil s podatki o napravah in sistemu Kadupul.  Samega agenta SNMP ne omogoči."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Vrsta pollerja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Vrsta pollerja, ki se uporablja.  Ta nastavitev bo začela veljati ob naslednjem intervalu poizvedovanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Interval sinhronizacije pollerja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Privzeti interval sinhronizacije poizvedovanja, ki se uporabi pri ustvarjanju pollerja.  Ta nastavitev vpliva na to, kako pogosto se oddaljeni polleri preverjajo in posodabljajo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Interval poizvedovanja, ki je v uporabi.  Ta nastavitev vpliva na to, kako pogosto se RRDfile preverjajo in posodabljajo.  <strong><u>OPOMBA: če to vrednost spremenite, morate ponovno zapolniti predpomnilnik pollerja.  Če tega ne storite, lahko pride do izgube podatkov.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Interval Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Pogostost, s katero se zažene zbiralnik podatkov Kadupul.  Za nadzor zagona zbiralnika podatkov Kadupul lahko uporabite crontab, načrtovano opravilo (za Windows) ali storitev systemd cactid.  Navodila za uporabo demona cactid najdete v datoteki README.md v imeniku service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Uravnoteži obremenitev procesov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Če izberete to možnost, bo Kadupul poskusil uravnotežiti obremenitev vsakega procesa pollerja z enakomerno porazdelitvijo elementov pollerja po procesih."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Širina razhroščevalnega izpisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Če izberete to možnost, bo Kadupul preveril izpis, ki presega njegove zmožnosti shranjevanja, in ob zaznavi izda opozorilo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Onemogoči preverjanje naraščajočega OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Nadzira onemogočanje preverjanja naraščajočega OID med prečkanjem drevesa OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev oddaljenega agenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Čas v sekundah, ki ga osrednji spletni strežnik Kadupul čaka na odgovor oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov za pridobitev različnih podatkov o napravi, preden zahtevek opusti.  Pri napravah, ki so povezane z drugimi zbiralniki podatkov kot osrednjim zbiralnikom podatkov Kadupul, je treba za zbiranje podatkov o napravi uporabiti oddaljenega agenta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Velikost pridobivanja SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OIDs should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Koliko OID naj se vrne na zahtevek snmpbulkwalk?  Pri napravah z velikimi drevesi SNMP povečanje te velikosti poveča zmogljivost ponovnega indeksiranja prek omrežja WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Omejitev SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Privzeto največje število OID SNMP Get, izdanih na zahtevek snmpget.  Pri napravah ta nastavitev nadzira raven naprave.  To nastavitev uporabite samo, če v svojih skriptih ali vtičnikih izvorno uporabljate API SNMP Kadupul."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Hramba zavrnjenih vzorcev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Ure, v katerih vzorci, ki jih RRDtool zavrne, na primer po spremembi sheme vira podatkov, ostanejo v čakalni vrsti za ponovni poskus, preden se premaknejo v tabelo poller_output_rejected.  Popravite RRDfile in nato zaženite cli/replay_rejected_samples.php za njihovo obdelavo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Omejitev zavrnjenih vzorcev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Največje število zavrnjenih vzorcev, ki jih lahko en vir podatkov hrani v čakalni vrsti.  Najstarejši vzorci nad to omejitvijo se takoj premaknejo v tabelo poller_output_rejected."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Onemogoči podvajanje predpomnilnika virov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Privzeto glavni zbiralnik podatkov Kadupul predpomni celotno spletno mesto in vtičnike v predpomnilnik virov.  Nato se oddaljeni zbiralniki podatkov občasno posodobijo z morebitnimi posodobitvami glavnega zbiralnika podatkov Kadupul.  Ta predpomnilnik virov oddaljenim zbiralnikom podatkov v bistvu omogoča samodejno nadgradnjo.  Če te možnosti ne želite uporabljati, jo lahko onemogočite s to nastavitvijo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Dodatne nastavitve zbiralnika podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Beleženje neveljavnih podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kako želite beležiti napake izpisa zbiralnika podatkov?  Možnosti vključujejo: 'Podrobno', ki podrobno navede vsako napako, 'Povzetek', ki poda število napak izpisa na napravo, in 'Brez', ki ne podaja števila napak."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Povzetek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Podrobno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Število strežnikov skriptov PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Število sočasnih procesov strežnika skriptov, ki se izvajajo na proces spine.  Sprejete so nastavitve med 1 in 15.  Ta parameter pomaga, če izvajate več niti in skriptov strežnika skriptov, in velja samo za zbiralnik podatkov spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Vrednost časovne omejitve skripta in strežnika skriptov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga bo spine čakal na dokončanje skripta.  Ta vrednost časovne omejitve je v sekundah in velja samo za zbiralnik podatkov spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Občasno ponovno indeksiranje vseh naprav"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Razpored ponovnega indeksiranja vseh naprav"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Kako pogosto želite ponovno indeksirati vse naprave?  To ponovno indeksiranje se bo izvedlo opolnoči s pogostostjo, ki jo izberete."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Tedensko ob nedeljah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mesečno ob nedeljah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve časovnih omejitev ozadja in sočasnih procesov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev ustvarjanja poročil"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript za ustvarjanje poročil Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minuta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev statistike virov podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript za statistiko virov podatkov Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript za preverjanje RRDfile Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s ura"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev ukazov pollerja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript za ukaze v ozadju Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit.  Ta skript opravlja naloge, kot sta ponovno indeksiranje naprav in odstranjevanje naprav iz oddaljenih zbiralnikov podatkov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Sočasni procesi ukazov pollerja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Število sočasnih procesov ukazov pollerja.  V skupini ukazov pollerja bo na gostitelja sočasno največ en ukaz."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proces"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d procesov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev ustvarjanja vzdrževanja v ozadju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript za vzdrževanje Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev ustvarjanja Spikekill v ozadju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Največji čas, ki ga lahko skript Spikekill Kadupul teče, ne da bi sprožil napako časovne omejitve in bil ubit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Privzete vrednosti zbiralnika podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Te nastavitve se vzdržujejo na ravni zbiralnika podatkov.  Vrednosti tukaj so samo privzete vrednosti, ki se uporabijo ob prvi ustvaritvi zbiralnika podatkov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Procesi zbiralnika podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Privzeto število sočasnih procesov, ki se izvajajo na zbiralnik podatkov.  OPOMBA: od različice Kadupul 1.2 se ta nastavitev vzdržuje v zbiralniku podatkov.  Odslej je ta vrednost samo prednastavitev za zbiralnik podatkov.  Višje število pri uporabi cmd.php izboljša zmogljivost.  Izboljšave zmogljivosti pri Spine se najbolje rešujejo s parametrom niti.  Pri uporabi Spine priporočamo nižje število in namesto tega uporabo niti.  Pri uporabi cmd.php ne uporabite več kot 2-kratnega števila jeder CPE."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Niti na proces"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Privzeto število niti, dovoljenih na proces.  OPOMBA: od Kadupul 1.2+ se ta nastavitev vzdržuje v zbiralniku podatkov, to pa je samo prednastavitev.  Višje število pri uporabi Spine izboljša zmogljivost.  Vendar poskrbite, da imate dovolj povezav MySQL/MariaDB za podporo naslednji enačbi: povezave = zbiralniki podatkov * procesi * (niti + strežniki skriptov).  Zagotoviti morate tudi dovolj rezervnih povezav za povezave ob prijavi uporabnikov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Način overjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Vgrajeno overjanje</i> - Kadupul upravlja overjanje uporabnikov, kar vam omogoča ustvarjanje uporabnikov in dodeljevanje pravic do različnih področij znotraj Kadupula.<br><br><i>Spletno overjanje Basic</i> - Overjanje upravlja spletni strežnik. Uporabniki se lahko ob prvi prijavi dodajo ali ustvarijo samodejno, če je določen uporabnik predloge, sicer se uporabijo določena dovoljenja gosta.<br><br><i>Overjanje LDAP</i> - Omogoča overjanje na strežniku LDAP. Uporabniki bodo ob prvi prijavi ustvarjeni samodejno, če je določen uporabnik predloge, sicer se uporabijo določena dovoljenja gosta.  Če modul LDAP za PHP ni omogočen, overjanje LDAP ne bo prikazano kot izbirna možnost.<br><br><i>Overjanje z več domenami LDAP/AD</i> - Skrbnikom omogoča podporo več ločenim skupinam iz različnih imenikov LDAP/AD za dostop do virov Kadupul.  Tako kot pri overjanju LDAP je za uporabo te metode potreben modul LDAP za PHP.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Podpora piškotkom za overjanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Če se uporabnik overi in izbere 'Ohrani me prijavljenega', bo na uporabnikovem računalniku ustvarjen piškotek za overjanje, ki uporabniku omogoča, da ostane prijavljen.  Piškotek za overjanje poteče po 90 dneh neuporabe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Posebni uporabniki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primarni skrbnik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Ime primarnega skrbniškega računa, ki bo samodejno prejemal e-pošto, ko ima sistem Kadupul težave.  Če želite prejemati to e-pošto, poskrbite, da so vaše nastavitve pošte pravilne in da ima skrbniški račun nastavljen e-poštni naslov."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Brez uporabnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Uporabnik gost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Ime uporabnika gosta za ogled grafov; privzeto je 'Brez uporabnika'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Predloga uporabnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Ime uporabnika, ki ga bo Kadupul uporabil kot predlogo za nove uporabnike Web Basic in LDAP; privzeto je 'guest'.  Temu uporabniškemu računu bo ob izbiri onemogočena prijava."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve osnovnega overjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Sporočilo o neuspeli prijavi z osnovnim overjanjem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Če pri uporabi osnovnega overjanja pride do težav s preslikavo uporabniškega imena v veljaven račun Kadupul, bo tukaj navedeno sporočilo prikazano uporabnikom.  Vsebuje lahko besedilo in HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Datoteka preslikave osnovnega overjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Če je treba pri uporabi osnovnega overjanja osnovni račun prevesti v drug račun za prijavo, lahko tukaj določite datoteko CSV, ki osnovni račun preslika v želeni račun za prijavo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Zahteve glede kompleksnosti lokalnih računov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Najmanjša dolžina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "To je najmanjša dolžina dovoljenih gesel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Zahtevaj mešane velikosti črk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "To bo zahtevalo, da nova gesla vsebujejo male in velike črke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Zahtevaj številko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "To bo zahtevalo, da nova gesla vsebujejo vsaj 1 številčni znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Zahtevaj poseben znak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "To bo zahtevalo, da nova gesla vsebujejo vsaj 1 poseben znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Vsili kompleksnost za stara gesla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "To bo zahtevalo, da tudi vsa stara gesla ob prijavi izpolnjujejo nove zahteve glede kompleksnosti.  Če jih ne, bo vsiljena sprememba gesla."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Pretek neaktivnih računov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "To je največje število dni, preden se neaktivni računi onemogočijo.  Račun Admin je iz tega pravilnika izključen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Pretek gesla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "To je največje število dni, preden geslo poteče."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Zgodovina gesel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Zapomni si to število starih gesel in prepreči njihovo ponovno uporabo."

