msgstr "1 sprememba"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d sprememb"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Zaklepanje računov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Zakleni račune"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Zakleni račun po tolikšnem številu neuspelih poskusov v 1 uri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 poskus"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d poskusov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Samodejno odklepanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Račun bo samodejno odklenjen po tolikšnem številu minut.  Tudi če je vneseno pravilno geslo, se račun ne bo odklenil, dokler ta časovna omejitev ni dosežena.  Največ 1440 minut (1 dan)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Splošne nastavitve LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Strežniki"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Z presledki ločen seznam imen gostiteljev DNS ali naslovov IP veljavnih strežnikov LDAP.  Kadupul bo za overjanje uporabnika poskušal uporabiti strežnike LDAP od leve proti desni."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Standardna vrata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "Vrata TCP za komunikacijo brez SSL, vključno z LDAP + TLS.  Privzeto je 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "Vrata SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "Vrata TCP za LDAPS za komunikacijo SSL.  Privzeto je 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Različica protokola"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Različica protokola za povezavo s strežnikom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev povezave"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Časovna omejitev omrežne povezave v sekundah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev vezave"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Časovna omejitev vezave (bind) v sekundah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "Način razhroščevanja LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Če je označeno, bo Kadupul med dejavnostmi vezave in iskanja v dnevnik Kadupul zapisoval dodatne podatke LDAP."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Šifriranje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Šifriranje, ki ga strežnik podpira. OPOMBA: pri uporabi LDAP + TLS morate uporabiti različico 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Zahteve glede potrdil TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Ali naj LDAP preveri potrdila TLS, ko jih prejme odjemalec.  Zahtevaj in Strogo zavrneta strežnik, katerega potrdilo ni preverjeno.  Nikoli in Dovoli to preverjanje preskočita, zato se lahko vsakdo na omrežni poti predstavi kot imenik in prebere gesla, poslana nanj."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Napotitve"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Omogoči ali onemogoči napotitve LDAP.  Če so onemogočene, se lahko hitrost iskanj poveča."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Način, na katerega bo Kadupul poskušal overjati na strežniku LDAP.<blockquote><i>Brez iskanja</i> - Iskanje razločevalnega imena (DN) ne poteka, le poskus vezave z zagotovljeno obliko razločevalnega imena (DN).<br><br><i>Anonimno iskanje</i> - Poskuša poiskati uporabniško ime v imeniku LDAP prek anonimne vezave, da bi našel uporabnikovo razločevalno ime (DN).<br><br><i>Specifično iskanje</i> - Poskuša poiskati uporabniško ime v imeniku LDAP prek določenega razločevalnega imena (DN) in določenega gesla za vezavo, da bi našel uporabnikovo razločevalno ime (DN)."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Razločevalno ime (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Skladnja »Razločevalno ime«, ki velja za konfiguracije OpenLDAP in Windows AD, omogoča prožnost pri določanju identitete uporabnika. Za OpenLDAP je oblika naslednja: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD ponuja nadomestno skladnjo: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, splošno znano kot »userPrincipalName (UPN)«. V tem okviru »&lt;username&gt;« predstavlja specifično uporabniško ime, vneseno ob prijavi. To je še zlasti pomembno pri delovanju v načinu »Brez iskanja« ali ko je omogočeno »Zahtevaj članstvo v skupini«."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Zahtevaj članstvo v skupini"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Zahtevaj, da je uporabnik za overjanje član skupine. Nastavitve skupine morajo biti nastavljene, da to deluje; omogočitev brez ustreznih nastavitev skupine bo povzročila neuspeh overjanja."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve skupine LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Razločevalno ime skupine (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Razločevalno ime skupine, katere član mora biti uporabnik."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Atribut člana skupine"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "To se nanaša na specifični atribut v imeniku LDAP, ki vsebuje uporabniška imena članov skupine. Ključno je zagotoviti, da vrednost atributa ustreza konfiguraciji, določeni v »Razločevalno ime«, ali da je dejansko vrednost atributa mogoče iskati z nastavitvami, opisanimi v »Razločevalno ime«."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Vrsta člana skupine"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Določa, ali uporabniki v določenem atributu člana skupine uporabljajo polno razločevalno ime ali samo uporabniško ime."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Razločevalno ime"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve specifičnega iskanja LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Osnova iskanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Osnova iskanja v imeniku LDAP, na primer <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> ali <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Filter iskanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Filter iskanja za iskanje uporabnika v imeniku LDAP, na primer za Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> ali za OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' se zamenja z uporabniškim imenom, vnesenim ob prijavi. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Razločevalno ime iskanja (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Razločevalno ime za vezavo specifičnega iskanja v imenik LDAP."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Geslo iskanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Geslo za vezavo specifičnega iskanja v imenik LDAP."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve CN LDAP"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Polje, ki bo nadomestilo polno ime pri ustvarjanju novega uporabnika, vzeto iz LDAP. (v Windows: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pošta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Polje, ki bo nadomestilo e-pošto, vzeto iz LDAP. (v Windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "Povezovanje URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Osnovni URL strežnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "To je mesto strežnika, ki se uporabi za povezave na mesto Kadupul. Vključuje naj podimenik, če Kadupul ne teče iz korenske mape."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Možnosti e-pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Obvesti primarnega skrbnika o težavah"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Kadupul server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Kadupul user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Kadupul's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Ali naj bo primarni skrbnik po e-pošti obveščen v primerih, ko ima strežnik Kadupul težave?  Uporabniški račun primarnega skrbnika Kadupul je določen na zavihku Overjanje na strani nastavitev Kadupul. Privzeto je račun 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Preizkusna e-pošta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "To je e-poštni račun, ki se uporablja za pošiljanje preizkusnega sporočila, da se zagotovi pravilno delovanje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Poštne storitve"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Katera poštna storitev naj se uporabi za pošiljanje pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Ping poštnega strežnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Ali naj se poštni strežnik pingne pred pošiljanjem preizkusne e-pošte?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "E-poštni naslov pošiljatelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "To je e-poštni naslov, s katerega bo e-pošta videti poslana."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Ime pošiljatelja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "To je dejansko ime, s katerim bo e-pošta videti poslana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Prelom besed"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "To je število znakov, dovoljenih, preden se vrstica v e-pošti samodejno prelomi. (0 = onemogočeno)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Možnosti Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Pot do Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "To je pot do sendmail na vašem strežniku. (Uporablja se samo, če je kot poštna storitev izbran Sendmail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "Možnosti SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "Ime gostitelja SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "To je ime gostitelja/IP strežnika SMTP, na katerega boste poslali e-pošto. Za premostitev odpovedi ločite gostitelje s podpičjem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "Vrata SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Vrata strežnika SMTP, ki se uporabijo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Uporabniško ime za overjanje pri pošiljanju prek SMTP. (Pustite prazno, če overjanje ni potrebno.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "Geslo SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Geslo za overjanje pri pošiljanju prek SMTP. (Pustite prazno, če overjanje ni potrebno.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "Varnost SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Način šifriranja, ki se uporabi za e-pošto."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev SMTP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Vnesite časovno omejitev SMTP v sekundah."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Prednastavitve poročanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Privzeta oblika slike grafa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs?"
msgstr "Kakšna vrsta slike naj se uporabi za vgrajene grafe pri ustvarjanju novega poročila?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Email Size"
msgstr "Največja velikost e-pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the Email message including all attachments."
msgstr "Največja velikost e-poštnega sporočila, vključno z vsemi prilogami."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Kadupul Reporting"
msgstr "Raven beleženja pollerja za poročanje Kadupul"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file? WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Kako podrobne podatke želite pošiljati v datoteko dnevnika? OPOZORILO: če pustite katero koli drugo stanje kot NONE ali LOW, lahko hitro zapolnite prostor na disku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Omogoči prilagoditev za Lotus Notes (R)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Omogoči prilagoditev kode za specifično obravnavo e-poštnih odjemalcev Lotus Notes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "Možnosti DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primarni naslov IP DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Vnesite primarni naslov IP DNS, ki se uporablja za povratna iskanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekundarni naslov IP DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Vnesite sekundarni naslov IP DNS, ki se uporablja za povratna iskanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "Časovna omejitev DNS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Kadupul uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Vnesite časovno omejitev DNS v milisekundah.  Kadupul uporablja razreševalnik DNS na osnovi PHP."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve posodabljanja RRD na zahtevo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Omogoči posodabljanje RRD na zahtevo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take effect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this setting is required to be on."
msgstr "Ali naj Boost v Kadupul omogoči posodabljanje RRD na zahtevo?  Če to onemogočite, sprememba ne bo začela veljati do naslednjega cikla poizvedovanja.  Če imate oddaljene zbiralnike podatkov, mora biti ta nastavitev vklopljena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Posodabljalnik RRD na ravni sistema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Preden je mogoče počistiti posodobitev RRD na zahtevo, mora vedno steči en zagon pollerja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Kako pogosto naj Boost posodobi vse RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Ko omogočite boost, se vaše datoteke RRD posodobijo samo, ko jih zahteva uporabnik ali ko mine to časovno obdobje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Število procesov Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Število sočasnih procesov boost, ki se uporabijo za obdelavo vseh RRD v tabeli boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Način obdelave Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Kako Boost porazdeli posodobitve RRD. Razcepljeni procesi ob vsakem zagonu zaženejo zgoraj navedeno število procesov Boost. Delavci čakalne vrste sporočil namesto tega vsako particijo predajo delavcem Messenger."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Razcepljeni procesi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Delavci čakalne vrste sporočil"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Največ zapisov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Če izhodna tabela boost preseže to velikost v zapisih, se izvede posodobitev."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Največ elementov virov podatkov na prehod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Za optimizacijo zmogljivosti mora posodabljalnik RRD boost vedeti, koliko elementov virov podatkov naj se pridobi v enem prehodu.  Pazite, da ne nastavite previsoko, saj je lahko ogrožena zmogljivost risanja grafov med večjimi posodobitvami.  Če med posodobitvami opazite počasno risanje grafov ali poizvedovanje, zmanjšajte to število.  Privzeta vrednost je 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Največja dolžina argumenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Ko boost pošilja ukaze za posodobitev v RRDtool, ne sme preseči največje dolžine argumenta operacijskega sistema.  Ta se razlikuje glede na operacijski sistem in raven jedra.  Na primer: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ neomejeno"

