msgstr "Največja količina pomnilnika za poller Kadupul in poller statistike virov podatkov"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Native Alerting"
msgstr "Izvorno opozarjanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Native Alert Evaluation"
msgstr "Omogoči izvorno ovrednotenje opozoril"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the main Data Collector evaluate alert rules after each polling cycle and send their notifications? Alert rules read the rates that Data Source Statistics collects, so Data Source Statistics Collection must also be enabled."
msgstr "Ali naj glavni zbiralnik podatkov po vsakem ciklu poizvedovanja ovrednoti pravila opozoril in pošlje njihova obvestila? Pravila opozoril berejo stopnje, ki jih zbira statistika virov podatkov, zato mora biti omogočeno tudi zbiranje statistike virov podatkov."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Rules per Batch"
msgstr "Pravil opozoril na paket"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Število pravil opozoril, ki se preberejo in ovrednotijo skupaj. Časovni proračun se preveri med paketi."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
