msgstr "%d pravil"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Evaluation Time Budget"
msgstr "Časovni proračun ovrednotenja opozoril"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long one evaluation run may start new batches of rules. Sending queued notifications follows evaluation with the time left, and may send one batch even when the budget is spent. Rules not reached are evaluated first by the next run."
msgstr "Kako dolgo lahko en zagon ovrednotenja začenja nove pakete pravil. Pošiljanje čakajočih obvestil sledi ovrednotenju s preostalim časom in lahko pošlje en paket, tudi ko je proračun porabljen. Pravila, ki niso bila dosežena, bodo ovrednotena prva ob naslednjem zagonu."

#: include/global_settings.php
