msgstr "Vaš račun zbirke podatkov Kadupul ima dostop do zbirke podatkov o časovnih pasovih MySQL, ta zbirka pa je zapolnjena z globalnimi podatki o časovnih pasovih."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - nastavitve"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Kadupul system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Te nastavitve za uglaševanje zmogljivosti MySQL bodo pomagale, da vaš sistem Kadupul dlje časa deluje bolje in brez težav."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Priporočene nastavitve sistemskih spremenljivk MySQL"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Vrsta namestitve"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Nadgradnja z <strong>%s</strong> na <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, it is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Kadupul is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with Kadupul"
msgstr "V primeru težav toplo priporočamo, da počistite predpomnilnik brskalnika, zaprete in znova odprete brskalnik (ne le zavihka, na katerem je Kadupul) in poskusite znova, preden prijavite težavo pri Kadupulu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "V redkih primerih smo prejeli poročila uporabnikov, ki imajo manjše težave zaradi sprememb v kodi.  Te težave povzroča brskalnik, ki ohrani kodo pred nadgradnjo, in čeprav smo sprejeli ukrepe za zmanjšanje verjetnosti, se lahko še vedno pojavijo.  Če potrebujete navodila, kako počistiti predpomnilnik brskalnika, je <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> dobro izhodišče."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Če po čiščenju predpomnilnika in ponovnem zagonu brskalnika še vedno imate težave, nam jih sporočite in poskušali bomo ugotoviti vzrok."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Prehod z <strong>%s</strong> na starejšo <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Zdi se, da prehajate na starejšo različico.  Spremembe zbirke podatkov, narejene za novejšo različico, ne bodo razveljavljene in <i>lahko</i> povzročijo težave."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Izberite vrsto namestitve"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Možnosti namestitve:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "To izberite za primarno mesto."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Nov primarni strežnik"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Nov oddaljeni poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Oddaljeni pollerji se uporabljajo za dostop do omrežij, ki niso zlahka dostopna iz primarnega mesta."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Kadupul's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Naslednje informacije so bile določene iz konfiguracijske datoteke Kadupula. Če niso pravilne, pred nadaljevanjem uredite \"include/config.php\"."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o povezavi z lokalno zbirko podatkov"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Zbirka podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database User: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Uporabnik zbirke podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database Hostname: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Gostiteljsko ime zbirke podatkov: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Port: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Vrata: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Server Operating System Type: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Vrsta operacijskega sistema strežnika: <b>%s</b>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Central Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o povezavi z osrednjo zbirko podatkov"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Konfiguracija je samo za branje!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Vaša datoteka config.php mora biti med namestitvijo zapisljiva za spletni strežnik, da lahko konfigurirate oddaljeni poller.  Ko je namestitev končana, morate to datoteko nastaviti na samo za branje, da preprečite morebitne varnostne težave."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Konfiguracija pollerja"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Kadupul Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Kadupul database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Informacije o vašem oddaljenem pollerju Kadupul niso vključene v datoteko config.php.  Preglejte config.php.dist in nastavite spremenljivke: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i> itd.  Te spremenljivke morajo biti nastavljene in kazati nazaj na vaš primarni strežnik zbirke podatkov Kadupul.  To popravite in poskusite znova."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Spremenljivke oddaljenega pollerja"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Spremenljivke, ki morajo biti nastavljene v datoteki config.php, vključujejo naslednje:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Namestitveni program samodejno dodeli $poller_id in ga doda v datoteko config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Kadupul database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Kadupul install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Ko so vse spremenljivke nastavljene v datoteki config.php, morate $rdatabase_username dodeliti tudi dostop do glavnega strežnika zbirke podatkov Kadupul.  Sledite istemu postopku kot pri vsaki drugi namestitvi Kadupula.  Nato lahko pritisnete gumb 'Preizkusi povezavo'.  Če je preizkus uspešen, boste lahko nadaljevali in dokončali namestitev."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Dodatni koraki po namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Kadupul server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Kadupul database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Bistveno je, da lahko osrednji strežnik Kadupul prek MySQL komunicira z vsakim oddaljenim strežnikom zbirke podatkov Kadupul.  Ko je namestitev končana, morate urediti oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov in zagotoviti, da so nastavitve pravilne.  Preverite lahko z 'Preizkusi povezavo' pri urejanju oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Kritične lokacije in različice izvršljivih datotek"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Pred nadaljevanjem se prepričajte, da so vse te vrednosti pravilne."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Ena ali več poti je videti napačnih, nadaljevanje ni mogoče"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Preverjanja dovoljenj imenikov"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Pred nadaljevanjem se prepričajte, da so dovoljenja imenikov spodaj pravilna.  Med namestitvijo morajo biti ti imeniki v lasti uporabnika spletnega strežnika.  Te spremembe dovoljenj so potrebne, da lahko namestitveni program namesti pakete predlog naprav, ki vsebujejo datoteke XML in skripte, ki bodo postavljene v te imenike.  Če paketov ne želite namestiti, obstaja cli skripta 'install_package.php', ki jo lahko uporabite iz ukazne vrstice po končani namestitvi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Po končani namestitvi lahko nekatere od teh imenikov nastavite na samo za branje, da povečate varnost."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Kadupul remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Kadupul Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ti imeniki morajo po namestitvi ostati zapisljivi, da jih lahko postopek oddaljene sinhronizacije Kadupula posodablja ob spremembah glavnega spletnega mesta Kadupul"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Če nameščate pakete, morate po namestitvi paketov imenik scripts nastaviti nazaj na samo za branje, ker to izpostavlja spletno mesto."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Pri oddaljenih pollerjih je ključno, da imajo poti, ki jih boste pogosto posodabljali, vključno s potmi plugins, scripts in resources, dostop za branje/pisanje, saj mora zbiralnik podatkov te poti posodabljati iz vsebine glavnega spletnega strežnika."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Zapisljivo je zahtevano samo ob namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ni zapisljivo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Zapisljivo je zahtevano po končani namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Možne težave z dovoljenji"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the Kadupul folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Prepričajte se, da ima vaš spletni strežnik dostop za branje/pisanje do map Kadupula, ki so spodaj prikazane z napakami."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Če je na vašem strežniku omogočen SELinux, ga lahko trajno onemogočite ali ga začasno onemogočite in nato dodate ustrezna dovoljenja z ukaznovrstičnimi orodji SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Uporabnik '%s' mora imeti dovoljenje MODIFY za omogočanje branja/pisanja."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Spodaj je prikazan primer nastavitve dovoljenj map, čeprav jih boste morda morali prilagoditi glede na vaš operacijski sistem, uporabniške račune in želena dovoljenja."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "PRIMER:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed, the CSRF path should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Ko je namestitev končana, je treba pot CSRF nastaviti na samo za branje."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Vse mape so zapisljive"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "RRDfile Locations"
msgstr "Lokacije RRDfile"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Data Source paths could not be read, so RRDfile locations were not checked. Check them after the upgrade with the poller log."
msgstr "Poti virov podatkov ni bilo mogoče prebrati, zato lokacije RRDfile niso bile preverjene. Preverite jih po nadgradnji z dnevnikom pollerja."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Every Data Source RRDfile path is inside an allowed directory"
msgstr "Pot RRDfile vsakega vira podatkov je znotraj dovoljenega imenika"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Data Sources have an RRDfile path outside the RRA directory. This version only creates and updates RRDfiles inside the RRA directory or a directory listed in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, so these Data Sources will stop updating until one of the following is done:"
msgstr "%d virov podatkov ima pot RRDfile zunaj imenika RRA. Ta različica ustvarja in posodablja RRDfile samo znotraj imenika RRA ali imenika, navedenega v $config['rrd_additional_paths'] v include/config.php, zato se ti viri podatkov ne bodo več posodabljali, dokler ni izvedeno eno od naslednjega:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "List the directory that holds them in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, for example $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"
msgstr "Imenik, ki jih vsebuje, navedite v $config['rrd_additional_paths'] v include/config.php, na primer $config['rrd_additional_paths'] = array('/data/rrd');"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Or move them into the RRA directory with structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: stop the poller, list their directory in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] so the script accepts them, run it, then remove the entry. Do not move them by hand and clear the Data Source Path, which starts a new, empty RRDfile."
msgstr "Ali pa jih premaknite v imenik RRA z structure_rra_paths.php --proceed: ustavite poller, njihov imenik navedite v $config['rrd_additional_paths'], da jih skripta sprejme, jo zaženite, nato vnos odstranite. Ne premikajte jih ročno in ne počistite poti vira podatkov, ker to začne nov, prazen RRDfile."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "and %d more"
msgstr "in še %d"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "DATA SOURCES:"
msgstr "VIRI PODATKOV:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "See docs/rrd-path-containment.md for details."
msgstr "Podrobnosti so v docs/rrd-path-containment.md."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Zaščita z belim seznamom za preverjanje vnosa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Kadupul poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Metode vnosa podatkov Kadupula, ki kličejo skripto, je mogoče izkoristiti tako, da lahko neskrbnik povzroči škodo datotekam, ki jih ima v lasti račun pollerja, v primerih, ko nekdo poganja poller Kadupula kot root, pa lahko ogrozi operacijski sistem in napadalcem omogoči izkoriščanje vaše infrastrukture."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Kadupul was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Kadupul more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Kadupul administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Zato je bil Kadupul pred več različicami izboljšan z zmožnostmi belega seznama za tovrstne metode vnosa podatkov.  Čeprav to Kadupul varuje temeljiteje, poveča količino dela, ki ga mora skrbnik Kadupula opraviti za uvoz in upravljanje predlog in paketov."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and/or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Beli seznam deluje tako, da ko prvič uvozite metodo vnosa podatkov ali jo znova uvozite in se skripta in/ali argumenti na kakršen koli način spremenijo, so metoda vnosa podatkov in vsi ustrezni viri podatkov takoj onemogočeni, dokler skrbnik ne potrdi, da je metoda vnosa podatkov veljavna."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state easier, we have provided a validation script in Kadupul's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Da bi lažje prepoznali metode vnosa podatkov v tem stanju, smo v imeniku CLI Kadupula zagotovili skripto za preverjanje, ki jo je mogoče zagnati z naslednjimi možnostmi:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte poišče vse metode vnosa podatkov, ki so trenutno prepovedane, in poda podrobnosti o razlogu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte odpravi prepoved metod vnosa podatkov, ki so trenutno prepovedane."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Ta možnost skripte znova omogoči vse onemogočene vire podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Močno priporočamo, da posodobite config.php in omogočite to funkcijo z odkomentiranjem spremenljivke <b>$input_whitelist</b>, nato pa po končani spletni namestitvi zaženete zgornje tri možnosti skripte CLI."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Označite potrditveno polje spodaj, da potrdite, da ste prebrali in razumeli to varnostno skrb"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Prebral sem to izjavo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Privzeti profil"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Kadupul Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Izberite privzeti profil vira podatkov, ki bo uporabljen za popraševanje virov.  To je največji čas med pregledovanjem naprav za informacije, zato nižji ko je interval popraševanja, več dela je naloženega gostitelju strežnika Kadupul.  Izberite tudi predvideni ali konfigurirani interval Cron, ki ga želite uporabiti za zbiranje podatkov."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Interval Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Privzeto omrežje avtomatizacije"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Kadupul can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Kadupul lahko po končani namestitvi samodejno pregleda omrežje. Pri tem bo uporabil spodnji obseg omrežja za določitev obsega naslovov IP, ki jih je mogoče pregledati.  Za pregledovanje je določen vnaprej definiran nabor možnosti, ki vključuje skupnosti 'public' in 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Če vaše naprave zahtevajo, da se najprej uporabi drug nabor možnosti, jih lahko definirate spodaj in uporabljene bodo pred privzetimi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Vse možnosti je mogoče prilagoditi po namestitvi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Privzete možnosti"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Način pregleda"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Obseg omrežja"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Dodatne privzete vrednosti"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Dodatne možnosti SNMP"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
msgstr "Napaka pri iskanju profilov"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Namestitve ni mogoče nadaljevati, ker ni bilo mogoče najti nobenega profila."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "To se lahko zgodi, če imate prazno zbirko podatkov in še niste uvozili datoteke cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Nastavitev predlog"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Izberite predloge naprav, ki jih želite posodobiti med nadgradnjo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any effect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Posodabljanje predlog, ki ste jih že spremenili, ni priporočljivo.  Nadgradnja predlog NE bo odstranila sprememb predlog grafov in podatkov ter lahko povzroči nepričakovano vedenje.  Če pa niste spremenili nobene predloge grafa, podatkovne poizvedbe ali podatkov, ponovni uvoz paketa ne bi smel imeti učinka.  V tem primeru boste morali po posodobitvi iz predlog izvesti 'Sinhroniziraj grafe'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Izberite predloge naprav, ki jih želite uporabljati po namestitvi.  Če je vaš operacijski sistem Windows, morate izbrati predlogo 'Windows Device'.  Če je vaš operacijski sistem Linux/UNIX, izberite predlogo naprave 'Local Linux Machine'."

