#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ in MariaDB 10.0+ sta odlični izdaji in zelo dobri različici za izbiro. Vendar zagotovite, da uporabljate najnovejšo izdajo, ki odpravlja dolgoletno težavo nizkonivojskega omrežja, ki je povzročala številne težave z zanesljivostjo pri spine."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "MOČNO priporočamo, da omogočite InnoDB v vsaki različici %s, višji od 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Pri uporabi Kadupula z jeziki, ki niso angleščina, je pomembno uporabiti vrsto primerjave znakov utf8mb4_unicode_ci, ker nekateri znaki zasedejo več kot en bajt."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Pri uporabi Kadupula z jeziki, ki niso angleščina, je pomembno uporabiti nabor znakov utf8mb4, ker nekateri znaki zasedejo več kot en bajt."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Priporočamo, da omogočite InnoDB v vsaki različici %s, višji od 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Odvisno od števila prijav in uporabe zbiralnika podatkov spine bo %s potreboval veliko povezav.  Izračun za spine je: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), nato morate pustiti rezervo za uporabniške povezave, ki se spreminja glede na število hkratnih prijavnih računov."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means fewer file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Večji predpomnilnik tabel pomeni manj operacij odpiranja/zapiranja datotek pri uporabi innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Z zmožnostmi oddaljenega popraševanja se bodo velike količine podatkov sinhronizirale iz glavnega strežnika na oddaljene pollerje.  Zato ohranite to vrednost pri 16M ali več."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Če uporabljate Kadupul Performance Booster in izberete pomnilniški pogon shrambe, morate paziti, da izpraznite medpomnilnik Performance Boosterja, preden sistemu zmanjka prostora za pomnilniške tabele.  To storite na dva načina: prvi je zmanjšanje velikosti izhodnega stolpca na ravno pravo velikost.  Ta stolpec je v tabelah poller_output in poller_output_boost.  Drugi je dodelitev več pomnilnika pomnilniškim tabelam.  Samovoljno smo izbrali priporočeno vrednost 10%% sistemskega pomnilnika, vendar če uporabljate diske SSD ali imate manjši sistem, lahko to priporočilo prezrete ali izberete drug pogon shrambe.  Pričakovano porabo tabel Performance Boosterja si lahko ogledate pod Konzola -> Sistemski pripomočki -> Ogled stanja Boost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size keeps those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Pri izvajanju podpoizvedb večja velikost začasne tabele ohrani te začasne tabele v pomnilniku."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and/or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Pri izvajanju združevanj (join), če so pod to velikostjo, bodo ohranjena v pomnilniku in nikoli zapisana v začasno datoteko.  Ker je to dodelitev pomnilnika na povezavo, morate paziti, da je ne povečate preveč.  Vsota join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + pomnilnik jedra MySQL/MariaDB mora biti pod 80%.  Če je priporočilo negativno, morate to in/ali sort_buffer_size zmanjšati, dokler priporočilo ne ustreza dovoljenemu pomnilniku."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Pri uporabi shrambe InnoDB je pomembno, da so tabelni prostori ločeni.  To poenostavi upravljanje tabel za dolgoletne uporabnike %s.  Če trenutno deluje z izklopljeno, lahko preidete na shrambo po datotekah z omogočitvijo funkcije in nato izvedbo stavka alter na vseh tabelah InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Pri uporabi innodb_file_per_table je pomembno nastaviti innodb_file_format na Barracuda.  Ta nastavitev omogoča daljše indekse, pomembne za nekatere tabele Kadupula."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that cannot properly create tables."
msgstr "Če imajo vaše tabele zelo velike indekse, morate uporabljati innodb_file_format Barracuda in innodb_large_prefix, enak 1.  Če tega ne storite, vtičniki morda ne bodo mogli pravilno ustvarjati tabel."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as many tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your system's total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your system's size."
msgstr "InnoDB bo v sistemskem pomnilniku hranil čim več tabel in indeksov.  Zato naj bo innodb_buffer_pool dovolj velik, da v pomnilniku drži čim več tabel in indeksov.  Preverjanje velikosti imenika /var/lib/mysql/cacti vam bo pomagalo določiti to vrednost.  Priporočamo 25%% celotnega pomnilnika vašega sistema, vendar se vaše zahteve spreminjajo glede na velikost sistema."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This setting should remain ON unless your Kadupul instance is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Ta nastavitev naj ostane VKLOPLJENA, razen če vaš primerek Kadupula deluje na ZFS ali FusionI/O, ki imata notranje beleženje (journaling) za nenadne sesutja sistema.  Če pa imate zelo dobro napajanje, vaši sistemi redko odpovejo in imate varnostne kopije, lahko izklop te nastavitve prinese skoraj 50-odstotno povečanje zmogljivosti zbirke podatkov."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Tu so shranjeni metapodatki. Če imate veliko tabel, bi bilo koristno to povečati."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not cause the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Nepridiprave poizvedbe ne bi smele povzročiti, da zbirka podatkov za druge ni več dosegljiva.  Prekinite te poizvedbe, preden prekinejo vaš sistem."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Največja zmogljivost V/I je dosežena, ko za praznjenje strani uporabite metodo O_DIRECT."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Nastavitev te vrednosti na 2 pomeni, da boste izpraznili vse transakcije vsako sekundo namesto ob potrditvi.  To omogoča, da %s zapisuje redkeje."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pri sodobni shrambi tipa SSD je več niti V/I koristnih za aplikacije z visokimi zahtevami V/I."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Od %s %s lahko nadzirate, kako pogosto %s izprazni transakcije na disk.  Privzeto je 1 sekunda, vendar lahko v sistemih z visokim V/I nastavitev na vrednost, višjo od 1, omogoči bolj zaporedni V/I diska"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pri sodobni shrambi tipa SSD je več niti branja V/I koristnih za aplikacije z visokimi zahtevami V/I.  Glede na vaše različice MariaDB/MySQL je lahko ta vrednost do 64.  Vendar poskusite ohraniti število manjše od skupnega števila niti SMT na strežniku zbirke podatkov."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Pri sodobni shrambi tipa SSD je več niti pisanja V/I koristnih za aplikacije z visokimi zahtevami V/I.  Glede na vaše različice MariaDB/MySQL je lahko ta vrednost do 64.  Vendar poskusite ohraniti število manjše od skupnega števila niti SMT na strežniku zbirke podatkov."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s bo innodb_buffer_pool razdelil na pomnilniška področja za izboljšanje zmogljivosti pri različicah MariaDB, nižjih od 10.5.  Največja vrednost je 64, vendar ne sme presegati števila jeder/niti CPE.  Ko je vaš innodb_buffer_pool manjši od 1 GB, uporabite velikost bazena, deljeno s 128 MB.  To enačbo uporabljajte do največ števila jeder CPE ali 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL up to and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s bo innodb_buffer_pool razdelil na pomnilniška področja za izboljšanje zmogljivosti pri različicah MySQL do vključno MySQL 8.0.  Največja vrednost je 64, vendar ne sme presegati števila jeder/niti CPE.  Ko je vaš innodb_buffer_pool manjši od 1 GB, uporabite velikost bazena, deljeno s 128 MB.  To enačbo uporabljajte do največ števila jeder CPE ali 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Če imate diske SSD, uporabite ta predlog.  Če imate fizične trde diske, uporabite 200 * število aktivnih diskov v polju.  Pri uporabi NVMe ali PCIe Flash je mogoče uporabiti veliko višja števila, tudi do 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Če imate diske SSD, uporabite ta predlog.  Če imate fizične trde diske, uporabite 2000 * število aktivnih diskov v polju.  Pri uporabi NVMe ali PCIe Flash je mogoče uporabiti veliko višja števila, tudi do 200000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Če imate diske SSD, uporabite ta predlog. V nasprotnem primeru te nastavitve ne nastavljajte."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pri sodobni shrambi tipa SSD je več niti branja V/I koristnih za aplikacije z visokimi zahtevami V/I."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Pri sodobni shrambi tipa SSD je več niti pisanja V/I koristnih za aplikacije z visokimi zahtevami V/I."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Pri uporabi MariaDB 10.2.4 in novejše mora biti ta nastavitev izklopljena, če so omogočeni atomski zapisi.  Zato namesto medpomnilnika dvojnega zapisa omogočite atomske zapise, saj bodo povečali zmogljivost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Pri uporabi MariaDB 10.2.4 in novejše lahko za povečanje zmogljivosti uporabite atomske zapise namesto medpomnilnika dvojnega zapisa."

