#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collector's Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump its Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>OPOMBA:</strong> Prijavljeni ste v oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov.  Ko je <b>'na povezavi'</b>, boste lahko pregledovali in upravljali velik del glavnega spletnega mesta Kadupul, kot da bi bili prijavljeni vanj.  Pomembno je tudi omeniti, da morajo oddaljeni zbiralniki podatkov uporabljati funkcijo <b>'Posodabljanje na zahtevo'</b> storitev za pospeševanje zmogljivosti Kadupula, in vedno priporočamo uporabo Spine.  Ko je oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov <b>'brez povezave'</b>, bo spletno mesto oddaljenega zbiralnika podatkov vsebovalo precej manj informacij.  Vendar bo predpomnil vse posodobitve, dokler glavna zbirka podatkov Kadupula in spletni strežnik nista dosegljiva.  Nato bo izpis tabele Boost vrnil v glavno zbirko podatkov Kadupula za posodobitev."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>OPOMBA:</strong> Nobeden od osnovnih vtičnikov Kadupul do danes ni bil prenovljen za delovanje z oddaljenimi zbiralniki podatkov.  Zato vtičniki, kot sta MacTrack in HMIB, ki zahtevata neposreden dostop do naprav, trenutno ne bodo delovali z oddaljenimi zbiralniki podatkov.  Vendar vtičniki, kot je Thold, delujejo, dokler je oddaljeni zbiralnik podatkov v načinu <b>'na povezavi'</b>."

